    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Server</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920520/extras/8984f82757e3a8bd07ba857bf2c5c64f.poster.avif?t=1721345777\" width=590 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920520/extras/8984f82757e3a8bd07ba857bf2c5c64f.webm?t=1721345777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920520/extras/8984f82757e3a8bd07ba857bf2c5c64f.mp4?t=1721345777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to relive the soul of the '80s in RetroZen!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Experience Iconic Cars:</strong> <i>Cruise in over 15 iconic cars, from classics to supercars, each crafted with attention to detail and nostalgia in mind.</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Endless Exploration:</strong> <i>Explore tons of unique maps, from neon-filled cityscapes to trippy wormholes, each offering a distinct atmosphere and a brand-new experience.</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Customize Your Ride:</strong> <i>Personalize your cars to make them your own, from performance upgrades to colors, rims, and neon lights!</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Groove to the Beat:</strong> <i>Enjoy a curated playlist of synthwave tracks that perfectly capture the funky and fun soul of the '80s, making every drive a nostalgic journey. Each map will react differently to the music you are listening to via unique rhythm effects, immersing both you and the game in the vibe!</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Retro Aesthetics:</strong> <i>Experience the golden era of gaming with our various retro screen effects.</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Endless Enjoyment:</strong> <i>Dive into a satisfying gameplay loop with numerous upgrades, unlockable cars, and endless roads to explore, all designed for pure relaxation and endless fun.</i></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to RetroZen, where every ride is a trip down memory lane, and every moment is soaked in the iconic vibes of the '80s!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920520/extras/8984f82757e3a8bd07ba857bf2c5c64f.poster.avif?t=1721345777\" width=590 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920520/extras/8984f82757e3a8bd07ba857bf2c5c64f.webm?t=1721345777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920520/extras/8984f82757e3a8bd07ba857bf2c5c64f.mp4?t=1721345777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get ready to relive the soul of the '80s in RetroZen!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Experience Iconic Cars:</strong> <i>Cruise in over 15 iconic cars, from classics to supercars, each crafted with attention to detail and nostalgia in mind.</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Endless Exploration:</strong> <i>Explore tons of unique maps, from neon-filled cityscapes to trippy wormholes, each offering a distinct atmosphere and a brand-new experience.</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Customize Your Ride:</strong> <i>Personalize your cars to make them your own, from performance upgrades to colors, rims, and neon lights!</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Groove to the Beat:</strong> <i>Enjoy a curated playlist of synthwave tracks that perfectly capture the funky and fun soul of the '80s, making every drive a nostalgic journey. Each map will react differently to the music you are listening to via unique rhythm effects, immersing both you and the game in the vibe!</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Retro Aesthetics:</strong> <i>Experience the golden era of gaming with our various retro screen effects.</i><br><br></li><li><strong>Endless Enjoyment:</strong> <i>Dive into a satisfying gameplay loop with numerous upgrades, unlockable cars, and endless roads to explore, all designed for pure relaxation and endless fun.</i></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to RetroZen, where every ride is a trip down memory lane, and every moment is soaked in the iconic vibes of the '80s!</strong></h2>",
